[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4160913935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008#issuecomment-4160913935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118008","id":4160913935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74AoIP","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T08:40:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T08:40:36Z","body":"> Instead of a fixed size, can it be a minimum size for 2 characters, and then use the label size if it is more?\r\n\r\nPerhaps it would be optimal to use `max(LabelSizes)` per page so we always get the most suitable visuals.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4160913935/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4172854527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008#issuecomment-4172854527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118008","id":4172854527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74uLT_","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T20:43:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T06:26:00Z","body":"\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4468e1ee-4636-4d91-82dc-48e37f7a60be\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4172854527/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4174120258","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008#issuecomment-4174120258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118008","id":4174120258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74zAVC","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T02:00:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T02:05:22Z","body":"I did some digging, it looks like the button returns the wrong minimum size because its `theme_cache.max_style_size` is outdated because it is out of the tree when the theme type variation is set (`reorder_button->set_theme_type_variation(SNAME(\"EditorInspectorFlatButton\"));`) so the `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED` doesn't get sent to update it. It gets updated when it is added to the tree. I don't think we can easily force it to update earlier, so `get_minimum_size` on the button has to be called after it enters the tree. \r\nIn this case the `name_size` has to be calculated in the first iteration of the loop right before it is used. It can be in a `if (name_size == 0)` condition or something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4174120258/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4194070548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008#issuecomment-4194070548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot